    <deploymentStatus>Deployed</deploymentStatus>
    <description>ALF-RS-08 (LFRDN-338) FR13: one row per document required before a Reservation Contract can be generated, so the check is a real reference-and-link, not a bare self-attestation checkbox. Rows are seeded per reservation from AF_RequiredDocumentType__mdt (the configurable list - HLD&apos;s own document set is explicitly &quot;Pending customer confirmation,&quot; so the list lives in metadata, not hardcoded Apex/Flow logic). AF_VehicleReservation__c.AF_RequiredDocumentsComplete__c is derived from whether every row here is Linked or Waived, replacing the old manual checkbox.</description>
